// Foes (game::combat): people-shaped enemies on the NPC rig (npcs.ron looks), each with a
// sword. Ctrl+Shift+J (Cmd+Shift+J) spawns a hollow, Ctrl+Shift+H a shade, a little ahead.
//   ghost:  see-through blue, shimmering, trailing wisps
//   weapon: item it holds (items.ron)
//   damage, cause: a cut that lands (Blunt | Piercing | Chill)
//   reach:  blocks a cut reaches; swing: seconds per swing (wind-up shows how it's coming)
//   walk, run: blocks/s
//   sight:  notices you within this (with a clear line); forget: gives up past this;
//   leash:  never strays further than this from where it began
//   style:  aggression / caution 0..1 (pressing vs circling and backing off),
//           guard 0..1 (chance it blocks your swing), poise (blocks before its guard breaks)
[
    (
        name: "hollow",
        title: "Hollow Warden",
        health: 40.0,
